    //
    // *** THE PROGRESS IS A PHASE COUNT AND THERE IS DELIBERATELY NO SECONDS TIMER. *** Each census is one
    // opaque call that returns when it returns, so "2 of 3" is the finest true thing available. A 90-second bar
    // would be a DRAWING: 96s is what THIS sandbox measured on one core, and a countdown hard-coded from it
