    // v3412 -- ARM THE BLAME PROFILER AND RESTART, as one action, because the two halves are useless apart: a
    // flag nobody reboots into never fires, and a reboot without the flag is the boot Keith has already had
    // eight times. THE RESTART IS THE EXISTING ONE -- this route adds the arming and delegates, rather than
