    // clothes. They come from layouts Keith actually made. Save REFUSES a layout that is not buildable -- the
    // opposite of the autosave below, and deliberately: an autosave fires on every keystroke and refusing would
    // lose the edit, while A PRESET IS A DELIBERATE ACT and storing a broken one just moves the failure to
